      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Protection of the Oppressed"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A song of ascents."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Since my youth they have often attacked me —",
          "let Israel say —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "since my youth they have often attacked me,",
          "but they have not prevailed against me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Plowmen plowed over my back;",
          "they made their furrows long."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord is righteous;",
          "he has cut the ropes of the wicked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let all who hate Zion",
          "be driven back in disgrace."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let them be like grass on the rooftops,",
          "which withers before it grows up ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and can’t even fill the hands of the reaper",
          "or the arms of the one who binds sheaves."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then none who pass by will say,",
          "“May the Lord’s blessing be on you.",
          "We bless you in the name of the Lord.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
